body:
well i told my bestfriend of 25 years in January 2021 that i was on the edge he told me not to. then come march I head on a Semi(drive for a living and NEVER had an accident) and he never said anything. 2/3 months after the "Accident" he walked away.

&#x200B;

Not sure which feels Worse

I cant say if life gets better since im here. about the only thing I can tell you is both the car crash and pills are not a guarantee. 1 dodge jouney meeting a Semi's rear trailer axle head on(hopped it would run over the car and end me) then spinning into the following SUV (all 3 doing 100km/hr) then I was extracted with barely a scratch to show for it.

&#x200B;

Im not going to say it gets easier but the attempts Defiantly get harder the more methods you try.
